description:
Objective: every isolated check observation carries an exact environment identity, and a changed environment needs new evidence (CQ-R11 DoD 3). The check boundaries the runner enforces are reported (the "reported" half of CQ-R11 DoD 2).

Split from CQ-R11 (task-0795112597cb453f93aaa5106e92d023) on 2026-10-29. The human chose in the architect REPL: one fresh owned VM per check run, deleted after it. This slice is pure and has no unlanded dependency.

Contract: a new scripts/local-runner/check-evidence.mjs, with pure functions only and no provider call.
- CHECK_BOUNDARIES: a deeply frozen descriptor of what the CQ-R11a/R11b guest check mode enforces:
  - identity: moe-check (JOB_IDENTITIES[1]), with no supplementary groups, NoNewPrivs and umask 077;
  - network: a private network namespace, loopback only;
  - resources: the guest VM size (GUEST_RESOURCES) plus named rlimits, whose values this task fixes. CQ-R11a enforces the same values, and its drift test pins them;
  - process: a session group killed and reaped, and the VM deleted after the run;
  - filesystem: a fresh owned VM per run and a fresh 0700 session home; protected paths root-owned and verified before and after the run; the supervisor credential root 0400 and readiness-denied to job identities (CQ-R07);
  - time: the budget is enforced by the host.
- checkEnvironment({sourceImageSha256, providerImageHash, supervisorSha256, resources}):
  - returns 'moe-local-vm-v1:' + the sha256 hex of a canonical JSON of the inputs and CHECK_BOUNDARIES;
  - inputs have exact keys; hashes are 64 lowercase hex; resources has the GUEST_RESOURCES shape;
  - a refusal is CHECK_INPUT_INVALID, with fixed text;
  - the result fits CheckRun.environment, an opaque value the daemon compares exactly.
- evidenceStatus(observation, current): 'fresh' only when environment, treeSha, definitionDigest and planRevision are all present and exactly equal; otherwise 'stale', meaning new evidence is required.
- Tests go in a NEW scripts/tests/local-runner-check.test.mjs, which every later CQ-R11 slice extends. Add it to the explicit file list of the CI local-runner step in .github/workflows/ci.yml.

Out of scope: running anything, the guest supervisor, sessions, VM lifecycle, the daemon's ingestion (CQ-V03), dispatch (CQ-V04), and any verified-local or isolation claim.

Verification command (fresh, exit 0 required): node --test scripts/tests/local-runner-check.test.mjs (on WSL: env -i with the nvm Node 24 PATH).
